#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_mx_avoid_reversal_entry
msgid ""
"\n"
".. figure:: https://img.shields.io/badge/licence-LGPL--3-blue.svg\n"
"    :alt: License: LGPL-3\n"
"\n"
"Avoid Reversal Entries\n"
"======================\n"
"\n"
"For Mexican companies, this module deletes the journal entries Odoo would\n"
"otherwise reverse when a reconciliation is undone.\n"
"\n"
"Odoo books two kinds of automatic entry while reconciling: the foreign-currency\n"
"exchange difference, and the cash-basis (CABA) entry for taxes whose\n"
"exigibility is *on payment*. Undoing the reconciliation normally leaves both in\n"
"place and posts a reversal alongside them. Mexican practice is to remove them\n"
"instead, so the accounts return to the state they were in before the\n"
"reconciliation existed.\n"
"\n"
"Two overrides implement that:\n"
"\n"
"- ``account.partial.reconcile.unlink`` deletes the exchange-difference and\n"
"  cash-basis entries reached from the partials being removed, together with\n"
"  their transitive closure, rather than reversing them. Only the partials\n"
"  actually being removed are considered: the other partials of the same full\n"
"  reconcile keep reconciling their lines, so their exchange difference stays on\n"
"  the books.\n"
"- ``account.move._check_draftable`` exempts those entries from the\n"
"  reset-to-draft guard, so they can be cancelled before deletion. The exemption\n"
"  is keyed on a private context flag, and the caller names the entries it is\n"
"  about to delete in a second key rather than letting the guard re-derive them:\n"
"  by the time the closure is cancelled the partials are gone, so the data no\n"
"  longer identifies the exchange-difference entries at all. Entries locked by\n"
"  the inalterability hash are never exempt: they cannot be deleted, by design.\n"
"\n"
"Non-Mexican companies are untouched and keep Odoo's reversal behaviour.\n"
"\n"
"Installation\n"
"============\n"
"\n"
"Install it as any other Odoo module: add the repository folder to the\n"
"``addons-path``, then go to ``Settings > Apps``, search for the module name and\n"
"click ``Install``.\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"No configuration is required. The module acts on every unreconciliation in a\n"
"Mexican company as soon as it is installed.\n"
"\n"
"Journals running with the inalterability hash enabled are the one exception:\n"
"an entry that has been hashed cannot be deleted, and unreconciling against one\n"
"is refused with a message naming every locked entry it found.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Issues are tracked as Odoo tasks under\n"
"`task 27153 <https://agromarin.mx/odoo/project.task/27153>`_ in the AgroMarin\n"
"project tracker. Please check there before reporting, and include the module\n"
"version from ``__manifest__.py``, the steps to reproduce, and the current and\n"
"expected behaviour.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"**Contributors**\n"
"\n"
"* Humberto Arocha <hbto@vauxoo.com> (Planner/Auditor)\n"
"* José Robles <josemanuel@vauxoo.com> (Developer)\n"
"* AgroMarin (fork maintenance)\n"
"\n"
"Maintainer\n"
"==========\n"
"\n"
"This module is maintained by AgroMarin in the\n"
"`Agro-Marin/agromarin <https://github.com/Agro-Marin/agromarin>`_ fork. It\n"
"originates from the Vauxoo Mexican localization.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_mx_edi_payment_preview
msgid ""
"\n"
".. figure:: https://img.shields.io/badge/licence-LGPL--3-blue.svg\n"
"    :alt: License: LGPL-3\n"
"\n"
"Mexico - Payment Complement Preview\n"
"===================================\n"
"\n"
"Adds a preview of the CFDI de Recepción de Pagos (REP, payment complement) that\n"
"can be rendered **before** the document is signed and stamped, so accounting can\n"
"check partialities, balances and taxes while a mistake is still free to fix.\n"
"\n"
"Without it, the only way to correct a wrong REP is to cancel it before the SAT\n"
"and stamp a new one.\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"\n"
"Hard boundary\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"The preview stops where ``l10n_mx_edi`` renders the CFDI values and never goes\n"
"past it. It does not:\n"
"\n"
"- sign the document (the local signing step in ``_send_api``),\n"
"- contact the PAC,\n"
"- create or modify any ``l10n_mx_edi.document`` record or its attachment.\n"
"\n"
"The rendered document carries a visible ``SIN SELLAR — NO ES UN CFDI VÁLIDO``\n"
"overlay so it cannot be mistaken for a stamped CFDI.\n"
"\n"
"How it works\n"
"============\n"
"\n"
"``l10n_mx_edi`` already separates *building the values* from *signing* them: the\n"
"payment template leaves ``Sello=\"TO BE INJECTED\"`` and the signature is injected\n"
"after rendering. This module reuses that seam:\n"
"\n"
"#. An override of ``_add_certificate_cfdi_values`` lets the value chain run\n"
"   without a valid certificate, but **only** under the preview context key — the\n"
"   real stamping flow is untouched. When a valid certificate is present the real\n"
"   values are used, since the preview should reflect what would be stamped.\n"
"#. A builder on ``account.move`` replays the value-assembly sequence and stops\n"
"   before signing.\n"
"#. A dedicated QWeb report renders those in-memory values.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"On a posted invoice with reconciled payments pending a complement, use the\n"
"**Vista previa del complemento** button next to *Update Payments*.\n"
"\n"
"Known limitations\n"
"=================\n"
"\n"
"- Reconciled invoices that are not yet stamped have no UUID. The stock engine\n"
"  drops such payments silently; this module blocks with an explicit error\n"
"  listing them, because that is precisely the mistake the preview exists to\n"
"  catch.\n"
"- ``NumParcialidad`` is derived from the current reconciliation state, not from\n"
"  a frozen sequence. It matches the stamped value for the most recent payment;\n"
"  previewing an older payment may show a different number.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Authors\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"- AgroMarin\n"
"\n"
"Maintainers\n"
"-----------\n"
"\n"
"- AgroMarin Sistemas\n"
msgstr ""

