"* **Production size** -- the hectare bucket the partner's cultivated area falls\n"
"  into, with ``hectares`` following the registered plots automatically.\n"
"* **Surface attributes** -- the EAV profile captured on the campaigns themselves\n"
"  (the attribute models keep the ``agro.attribute`` name).\n"
"\n"
